{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Stand Alone&quot;</strong> is an intense, action-movie-inspired shooter playable in both VR and non-VR (First Person Shooter). As a highly trained professional hitman - known and feared as <i>the Gunman</i>\u00a0- the player takes on ruthless forces in the criminal underworld, serving justice in places beyond the reach of the law \u2026 one contract at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its origins in the popular <i>Half-Life: Alyx</i> mods <strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Chapter 1 &amp; Chapter 2&quot;</strong>, <strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Stand Alone&quot;</strong> takes the action to the next level with a completely new, from-the-ground-up developed single-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will launch as an Early Access title with a limited set of content (and most likely quite the list of bugs and quirks!). The game is designed to grow during its Early Access phase, receiving additional content as development progresses - such as new story contracts, challenges, weapons, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Launch Package planned to Include</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 fully voiced and narrated story contracts (missions)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional challenge modes</strong> for each contract (Takedown and Last Stand)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gunman\u2019s base of operations</strong>\u00a0incl. training courses and challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target course</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target circle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holographic combat training</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable and customizable weapons:</strong> pistols, rifles, shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knives and a bow</strong> (bow not yet available in non-VR First Person mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam leaderboard integration</strong> for every contract and challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom music feature:</strong> drop your own music files into a folder and play them in-game via the Gunman\u2019s smartphone</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2421750?t=1768264611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421750/5b17f9d975618c964d1ba9f73ab6b7f0690630df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768264611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421750/c9af0a70e3d357013cc9056acdd2730489c83d47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768264611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421750/c9af0a70e3d357013cc9056acdd2730489c83d47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768264611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Modeld after gun blazing hollywood action thrillers, this game contains content not appropriate for all ages, and may not be appropriate for viewing at work, featuring frequent violence and general mature content.\r\n\r\nNote: this game can also be played in a \"low violence\" mode, which disables nearly all blood effects and splatter, but still keeps the action intact."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Stand Alone&quot;</strong> is an intense, action-movie-inspired shooter playable in both VR and non-VR (First Person Shooter). As a highly trained professional hitman - known and feared as <i>the Gunman</i>\u00a0- the player takes on ruthless forces in the criminal underworld, serving justice in places beyond the reach of the law \u2026 one contract at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its origins in the popular <i>Half-Life: Alyx</i> mods <strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Chapter 1 &amp; Chapter 2&quot;</strong>, <strong>&quot;Gunman Contracts \u2013 Stand Alone&quot;</strong> takes the action to the next level with a completely new, from-the-ground-up developed single-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will launch as an Early Access title with a limited set of content (and most likely quite the list of bugs and quirks!). The game is designed to grow during its Early Access phase, receiving additional content as development progresses - such as new story contracts, challenges, weapons, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Launch Package planned to Include</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 fully voiced and narrated story contracts (missions)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional challenge modes</strong> for each contract (Takedown and Last Stand)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gunman\u2019s base of operations</strong>\u00a0incl. training courses and challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target course</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop up target circle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holographic combat training</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable and customizable weapons:</strong> pistols, rifles, shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knives and a bow</strong> (bow not yet available in non-VR First Person mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam leaderboard integration</strong> for every contract and challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom music feature:</strong> drop your own music files into a folder and play them in-game via the Gunman\u2019s smartphone</p></li></ul>","developers":["ANB_Seth"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421750/485415c36bcefe36cbed8d8cef7d1b1eb2169c83/header.jpg?t=1768264611","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421750/1585305485/48e1eebf802fcb6a747ccf51c03a7b35e65a6719/1763210025/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763239740","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421750/1585305485/48e1eebf802fcb6a747ccf51c03a7b35e65a6719/1763210025/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763239740","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421750/1585305485/48e1eebf802fcb6a747ccf51c03a7b35e65a6719/1763210025/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763239740","id":257232252,"name":"The Gunmans Base","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257232252/107a613c2c3cb3b38449f10030bbe36e5409ae93/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763239740"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421750/576543286/9285e2552f8d5d55a8e89fd2f83295fe488aabc4/1763210290/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763239741","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421750/576543286/9285e2552f8d5d55a8e89fd2f83295fe488aabc4/1763210290/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763239741","highlight"